OL,3,AMPs and MSP detained by Israel and
OL,4,Abarred from entering West Bank
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo MPs and an MSP have said they were
OL,7,Fdetained by Israeli authorities for
OL,8,Feight hours while trying to enter the
OL,9,FWest Bank.
OL,11,FSNP MP Lara Bird, Labour MP Clive Lewis
OL,12,Fand Scottish Greens MSP Kate Nevens
OL,13,Fsaid they were prevented from entering
OL,14,Fthe territory on Monday before being
OL,15,Fquestioned and eventually turned away.
OL,17,FBird said in a social media post that
OL,18,Fthey had intended to "stand alongside
OL,19,FPalestinians being attacked for
OL,20,Fharvesting olives on their own land".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
